===Argentina vs Iceland===
[[File:FWC 2018 - Group D - ARG v ISL - Messi penalty kick.jpg|thumb|right|[[Lionel Messi]] missed a penalty kick]]
The two teams had never met before.<ref name=Kit>{{cite web|url=https://resources.fifa.com/image/upload/2018-fifa-world-cup-russiatm-statistical-kit.pdf?cloudid=fjqkfby8aur1lxnvnxdi |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180508111620/http://resources.fifa.com/image/upload/2018-fifa-world-cup-russiatm-statistical-kit.pdf?cloudid=fjqkfby8aur1lxnvnxdi |url-status=dead |archive-date=8 May 2018 |title=2018 FIFA World Cup – Statistical Kit|website=FIFA.com |publisher=Fédération Internationale de Football Association}}</ref>

Despite stamping their authority on the game's opening stages, Argentina struggled to find space against the Icelandic defence. Argentina then scored in the 19th minute, [[Sergio Agüero]] scoring with a powerful left foot shot to the top left corner of the net giving them a 1–0 lead. [[Alfreð Finnbogason]] made history by scoring his country's first World Cup goal just four minutes later when he slotted to the net from six yards out after the ball broke to him from six yards out.<ref name="ARG-ISL recap">{{cite web |url=https://inside.fifa.com/tournaments/mens/worldcup/2018russia/news/iceland-secure-historic-first-world-cup-point-2958355 |title=Iceland thwart Argentina on World Cup debut |publisher=FIFA |date=16 June 2018 |access-date=16 June 2018 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260520043555/https://inside.fifa.com/tournaments/mens/worldcup/2018russia/news/iceland-secure-historic-first-world-cup-point-2958355 |archive-date=20 May 2026}}</ref> Argentina then had the chance to go ahead again when [[Hörður Björgvin Magnússon]] pushed [[Maximiliano Meza (footballer, born 1992)|Maximiliano Meza]] inside the box after 64 minutes. [[Hannes Þór Halldórsson]] dove to his right to deny [[Lionel Messi]] a goal.<ref name="Goal Argentina v Iceland">{{cite web |last=Lancaster |first=Rob |title=Finnbogason makes history as Messi fluffs his big chance |url=http://www.goal.com/en-ke/match/argentina-v-iceland/report/a5bn20ladyztuqtjzv2l57bvt |website=Goal.com |date=16 June 2018}}</ref> Although Argentina continued to press for a goal, but they were repeatedly denied by the Icelandics' defense.<ref name="ARG-ISL recap"/>

Argentina failed to win their opening match at a World Cup tournament for the first time since losing to Cameroon in [[1990 FIFA World Cup|1990]], and it was the first time that they drew their opener in the competition. Argentina have missed their last two penalties taken at a World Cup finals (excluding shoot-outs), with [[Ariel Ortega]] failing to convert against Sweden in [[2002 FIFA World Cup|2002]] before Messi's effort against Iceland in 2018. The Iceland forward's goal after 23 minutes was the earliest scored for a nation playing in their first World Cup match since [[Rashidi Yekini]] netted after 21 minutes for Nigeria against Bulgaria on [[1994 FIFA World Cup Group D#Nigeria vs Bulgaria|21 June 1994]].<ref>{{cite web |last=Bevan |first=Chris |title=Argentina 1 Iceland 1 |url=https://www.bbc.com/sport/football/44422188 |work=BBC Sport |date=16 June 2018}}</ref>

