===Iceland vs Croatia===
The two teams had met in six matches, most recently in 2017 for the [[2018 FIFA World Cup qualification]], which ended in a [[2018 FIFA World Cup qualification – UEFA Group I|1–0]] Iceland victory.<ref name=Kit9/>

[[Hörður Björgvin Magnússon|Hörður Magnússon]] headed wide from [[Jóhann Berg Guðmundsson|Jóhann Guðmundsson]]'s outswinging corner. [[Alfreð Finnbogason]] shot wide from the edge of the area. [[Birkir Bjarnason]] pounced from a corner, but [[Lovre Kalinić]] made a save from [[Aron Gunnarsson]]'s curling effort. At the restart, [[Milan Badelj]]'s strike clattered off the crossbar. Badelj got his goal when he reacted to a loose ball in the Iceland box and hammered home from close range. [[Sverrir Ingi Ingason|Sverrir Ingason]]'s header rebounded back off the bar. [[Dejan Lovren]]'s handball though enabled [[Gylfi Sigurðsson]] to score from the spot in the 76th minute. Badelj provided a throughball and, having outpaced his marker, [[Ivan Perišić]] lashed home to score the winner.<ref>{{cite web |last=Reddy |first=Luke |title=Iceland 1 Croatia 2 |url=https://www.bbc.com/sport/football/44439256 |work=BBC Sport |date=26 June 2018}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Ridge |first=Patric |title=Perisic strikes late on to secure maximum points |url=http://www.goal.com/en/match/iceland-v-croatia/ek4mqlvymecadbww168frcs89 |website=Goal.com |date=26 June 2018}}</ref>

Croatia topped a world finals group for the first time in their history, and because of Croatia's victory, Argentina also qualified.<ref name="ISL-CRO recap">{{cite web |url=https://inside.fifa.com/tournaments/mens/worldcup/2018russia/news/isl-cro-review-words-2970706 |title=Croatia send brave Iceland home |publisher=FIFA |date=26 June 2018 |access-date=26 June 2018 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260520051907/https://inside.fifa.com/tournaments/mens/worldcup/2018russia/news/isl-cro-review-words-2970706 |archive-date=20 May 2026}}</ref> With the defeat, Iceland stood bottom in the group with a single point and were eliminated.

